WEBVTT

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.810
What... is this?

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.380
What... What...

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.190
<i>Mangetsu!</i>

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.400
Do you understand now? That's the real you.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.610
An empty doll that has absolutely nothing.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:23.040
You were just... made.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:45.020
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:44.850
The Two Princeps

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.820
Mangetsu!

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:06.830
Mangetsu, get away!

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.270
Trying to protect her?

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.480
I suppose that makes sense.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.070
You're the one who made her, after all.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:16.360
Me?

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:20.490
<i>Yes, you built her...</i>

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:25.740
out of your loneliness, sadness, and despair.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:29.540
<i>Magiaconatus responded to your feelings...</i>

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.210
To your desperate wish for a friend!

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.230
Doesn't that make you happy, Ernesta?

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:50.690
That's just how much Magiaconatus loves you.

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:53.780
Shingetsu-chan!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:59.130
Don't you get it? All the feelings 
you have toward Ernesta,

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.560
your wish to stay by her side,

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.070
and your determination to 
fight along with her...

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.210
They're all fabricated.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:10.290
You were made to be that way 
from the very beginning.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.170
Your ability to control that ARMANOX

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:16.350
and the release of your magical power

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:20.630
all happened because Magiaconatus 
used its magic on you!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.580
It's not your own power!

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.100
You're no more than a puppet!

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.350
She absorbed it...

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:37.720
Remember what I told you? 
"I will be your mirror."

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.770
It won't work. What did I just tell you?

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:48.320
You're just a puppet that moves 
the way Shingetsu wants you to.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:50.540
A puppet that has nothing.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.960
Mangetsu...

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:56.340
A completely empty doll!

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:10.790
Mangetsu...

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:15.030
Did you know... about me?

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.660
I'm sorry.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.530
Shingetsu-chan! Over there!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.280
Mangetsu...

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:36.500
Again?

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:55.910
I can hear...

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.360
Onee-chan's sound...

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.280
and what she's about to do.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.450
Listen closely.

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:07.220
Feel what my fingers are doing.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.530
<i>I see it... I can see it!</i>

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:16.540
<i>Beyond that point...</i>

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.730
No matter how fast you move...

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:27.430
<i>...is the key to Onee-chan's plan!</i>

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.470
Footsteps in the Silence!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.800
Medusa!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:53.770
I'm not done yet!

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.000
Kuon-chan!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.370
Do it, please!

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.300
She's absorbing it all again?

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:13.780
She's trying to fill up on magic.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.470
She's trying to avoid 
releasing any magical power.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:20.080
She's attacking enough to leave no openings,

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.590
but she just keeps absorbing all magic.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:25.070
<i>What happens when she's all filled up?</i>

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.190
I doubt we'll escape unharmed.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.910
This magic...

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.570
I just want to release it 
once. I don't care where.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:39.250
Onee-chan, why didn't you tell me?

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:48.130
If you had told me at the start, I...

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.270
You can't!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.050
There are dozens of them, aren't there?

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:55.580
And you have to be the last 
one left at the end, right?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.520
That's why I have to.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.930
To protect you.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:04.840
I'm sorry.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.030
After you did all that for me...

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.280
This is... Any more, and I'll...

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.160
How dare you?!

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:20.620
You're inside me, and you 
think you can just—

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.380
Isn't my sister amazing?

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.200
She knew she couldn't win,

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:32.090
so she thought hard about how 
she could make me a mage.

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.970
She surpassed and isolated time,

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.470
so that the two of us, together,

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.310
could have this one moment!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:49.610
I'm not done!

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:58.080
A magic circle?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.290
This is the spell

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:04.740
my sister left behind for me.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.090
Tenmu Ryuusei!

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.960
Medusa!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.540
Kuon-chan!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:45.920
Onee-chan...

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:53.570
I won't... Not while I still have 
all this magic accumulated...

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.800
I will always...

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.610
Looks like I've turned the tables on you.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.230
How...

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:25.790
I told you. My sister guided everything, 
so it would turn out this way.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.970
We will become the Princeps...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.760
My sister and I.

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:42.450
My sister knows everything.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:48.310
You didn't eat her back then.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:51.800
My sister ate you.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.870
I see you're human, too.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:07.040
So thoroughly shallow, crude, and ugly.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:13.040
Sorry, but that didn't hurt.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.560
I feel no pain at all.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.510
I didn't feel a thing.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.000
How nice for you.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:28.660
I'll let you two sisters be as one.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:39.570
Onee-chan...

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.680
Kuon-chan?

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.430
It's...

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:09.550
The battle is ending...

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:24.750
My hands just look normal here.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:26.690
Mangetsu...

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.190
Why?

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.040
Why didn't you tell me?

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.150
We weren't trying to hide it from you.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:40.720
Nene-chan...

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.320
I told her right before the battle started.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.710
I just didn't have time to tell you.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.460
So I'm... a doll?

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.130
I'm not human?

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:09.700
That's right. You're a doll 
created by Magiaconatus.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.930
With the power of its magic,

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:17.740
you existed just like any human who 
had been born and raised in this town.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:23.060
The magic of Magiaconatus even 
created memories and emotions

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.360
to plant inside you.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.260
That's why...

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.100
I'm going now.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.160
Wow, it's really coming down.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:39.650
Kibou...

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.360
Who are you?

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.480
Mom! Someone's here!

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.040
Mom...

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:00.710
Is there someone you're here to see?

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:12.720
I'm sorry!

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.760
Now, who can solve this problem?

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:12.640
How many seconds has it been?

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:16.470
Hmm... It's been 18 seconds, 
so number 18, Iwata, you're up.

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.050
Okay, next is Hakamada.

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.970
Drink this. It'll calm you down.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:49.530
That should stabilize you a bit.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.180
Stabilize?

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.990
With the magic interference gone,

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.600
your existence has become unstable.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.090
You'll be fine now, for a while.

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:02.530
Although, only mages can control magic,

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:05.250
so it's only the most basic solution.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.390
I'll get right to the point.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.170
You're not human.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:13.220
If left alone, your very existence 
would vanish for sure.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.920
To prevent that from 
happening, you need magic.

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:19.860
Magic...

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:26.400
For example, if the Princeps mage 
were to use magic on you...

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:28.360
You mean...

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:34.220
Unfortunately, there's no way a doll is 
qualified to become the Princeps mage.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:38.370
The only ones left who have that right

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.330
are that Suishou girl and Shingetsu-chan.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:45.460
Just them? Then Kuon-chan really is...

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:48.760
Kuon? Who's that? Do you know?

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:51.270
No, I don't.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.470
Kuon-chan, too...

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.110
I see.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:02.730
That means there are some people who 
lose their lives during the battle.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:06.590
And when that happens, powerful magic 
interference occurs in the area,

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:09.120
and their existence is erased.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.450
So that must have happened to 
lots of other girls in the past.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.410
It's just that no one remembers them.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.710
Why would that happen?

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:25.360
Isn't GRANBELM a battle to 
become the one true mage?

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:30.590
We all go in that space and fight 
to become the mage, right?

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.590
That's what we thought.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:37.140
But we were wrong.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:40.540
It's just what someone, or something, 
is leading us to believe.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.600
It lets us experience the hope 
that we can become a mage,

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.810
gets us to participate in GRANBELM,

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:50.530
and erases any inconvenient truths 
through magic interference.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:54.440
It created a doll and forced 
it to join the battle,

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:56.240
and it's even taking the fighters' lives.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:57.850
Who is?

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.450
Most likely...

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.340
Magiaconatus.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:09.840
Magiaconatus is searching 
for the Princeps mage.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.560
It seeks the one among the many candidates

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:16.180
whose heart is suited to the role.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:20.910
Then why does it take their 
lives and erase their existence?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.490
It's all part of the test.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:29.980
You don't get it?

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:33.090
Magic is a power too great for humans.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:37.450
The chosen must have the heart 
and strength to match it.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:42.750
They can't be people who'll just use it to 
fulfill their wishes or destroy things.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.330
Stop it...

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:49.580
What's more, unlike when the 
world was abundant in mages,

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:53.110
there can be only one Princeps mage.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:55.980
That one is basically regarded as a god.

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:58.850
So, you could say this is a test of godhood.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.550
Knowing that lives are taken 
and existences are erased,

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:04.210
plus that your dearest 
friend is actually a doll,

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:06.480
can you still strive to be that mage?

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.290
I'm going to tell you something.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.900
You are loved by magic.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.030
Magiaconatus has high hopes for you.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:36.910
That's why you were blessed with 
magic and power from birth,

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:41.000
and have been able to 
demonstrate your talents.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:45.740
You were being tested to see 
whether you were fit to use them.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.520
Surely this all rings a bell, doesn't it?

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:50.770
It can't be...

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.680
You don't even know

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.180
why you have no parents,

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:59.570
why the friend you made at the home that 
took you in went mad with envy against you,

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.730
or why the one true friend 
you found was a doll?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:06.540
Impossible...

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:10.060
Oh, it's possible. Who do you 
think you're dealing with?

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:13.100
It's a being comprised of all 
the magical power in the world.

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:17.200
Even when sealed by humans, it can 
do anything it sets out to do.

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:23.680
You are the Princeps mage candidate 
most loved by Magiaconatus.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:29.480
It expects you to win GRANBELM, overcome 
all trials, and become that mage.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.490
Me?

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:34.860
But...

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:41.020
I don't believe that. You...

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:45.120
No, the so-called human fit 
to be a mage does not exist.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:49.580
I will prove that by winning GRANBELM.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.850
Are you sure?

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:04.550
Yeah. I want some time to 
think about things alone.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.350
Thank you.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:10.000
We have a spare room. You're 
welcome to use it anytime.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.240
No one gave you permission to do that.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.100
That means she's okay with it.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.800
Okay. Bye.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.800
Make sure you talk this over.

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:20.570
Huh?

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.630
With Shingetsu, I mean.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:24.820
We can't do everything for you, you know.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:32.000
I'm sure Shingetsu is thinking 
about how she can help you.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:33.960
Okay.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.060
What should I say?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:48.430
If Shingetsu-chan becomes the Princeps mage,

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.710
she can use her magic to save me,

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:54.010
to make sure I don't disappear.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.650
But that would mean...

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:00.650
I want to truly erase all magic and mages 
from this world once and for all.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.600
...that magic wouldn't truly go away.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:09.870
If I just disappeared now,

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:13.370
maybe Shingetsu-chan's 
wish would come true...

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:14.580
But...

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:22.950
No!

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:25.690
No! No!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:26.510
No!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:38.980
I'm so scared.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:43.060
Even though I'm not even alive...
 I'm not even alive...

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.770
I'm not even alive!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:47.940
It hurts...

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:57.140
I'm not even alive...

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:00.650
Why does it hurt?

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:18.820
Are you...

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.750
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:58.260 --> 00:24:03.040
<i>As Mangetsu wanders in darkness 
after learning what she truly is,</i>

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:05.840
<i>Shisui, who has lost her 
sister, appears before her.</i>

00:24:06.220 --> 00:24:09.340
<i>Coincidence and inevitability, 
hope and despair...</i>

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:12.180
<i>In this world of interwoven feelings,</i>

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:16.100
<i>Mangetsu makes a decision 
and runs toward the others.</i>

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:18.510
<i>Next time on </i>GRANBELM<i>,</i>

00:24:18.510 --> 00:24:21.270
<b>Even If My Goodbye Doesn't Reach You</b>

00:24:18.790 --> 00:24:21.270
<i>"Even If My Goodbye Doesn't Reach You."</i>

00:24:22.220 --> 00:24:24.930
<i>And then, the moon rises...</i>

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.030
<b>Look forward to the next episode!</b>
